# EdSteward App (packages/app)

## Tech Stack

- **Frontend:** React 18, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui (Radix), Wouter, TanStack Query
- **Backend:** Express.js, TypeScript (tsx)
- **Database:** PostgreSQL (Neon Serverless), Drizzle ORM
- **Auth:** Passport.js (Local + SAML/Okta/CAS2/OIDC), JWT, MFA (TOTP)
- **Hosting:** AWS ECS Fargate, ALB, ECR, Route53
- **Container:** Docker multi-stage build (Colima on macOS)

## Key Files

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `shared/schema.ts` | Drizzle ORM schema — single source of truth for all DB tables |
| `server/index.ts` | Express server entry point |
| `server/routes/api/` | ~32 API route modules |
| `server/mcp-integration-api.ts` | Receives regulation data from MCP Engine |
| `server/auth.ts` | Passport strategies and session config |
| `client/src/pages/` | ~30 React page components |
| `client/src/lib/version.ts` | App version string |
| `admin-console/` | Separate admin app (frontend port 3001, backend port 4000) |
| `.env` | Environment variables — never commit secrets |

## Architecture

- **Multi-tenant:** Database-per-tenant via Neon Serverless PostgreSQL, subdomain routing
- **Single-tenant mode:** Default for local dev (uses `DATABASE_URL` from `.env`)
- **Attestation system:** Magic link tokens for external users to upload evidence and sign attestations
- **Compliance tasks:** Assigned to regulations with evidence requirements, DRI assignment, email notifications

## Local Dev

```zsh
npm run dev                           # Main app on port 3000
cd admin-console && npm run dev       # Admin frontend on port 3001
cd admin-console/server && npx tsx watch index.ts  # Admin backend on port 4000
```

Check health: `curl -s http://localhost:3000/api/health`

## Deployment Flow

Code -> Commit -> Push -> Tag -> `./scripts/deploy-staging.sh` -> Verify -> `./scripts/deploy-production.sh`

## Common Pitfalls

- **EADDRINUSE:** Check if a service is already running and healthy before killing anything
- **Admin console DB error:** Ensure dotenv path is correct in `admin-console/server/config/database-connections.ts`
- **MFA warnings on startup:** Expected in dev — set `MFA_ENCRYPTION_KEY` env var to suppress
- **Schema changes:** Run `npm run db:push` after editing `shared/schema.ts`
